and `v z = y`. It therefore proves the inverse action sends `x` to `y`, once
the two shorter evaluations have been checked. The last two witnesses use
indices of the already checked 3159-label table. No orbit inclusion or action
identity is assumed by these definitions.
Source: retained ATLAS word program and `StagesTwoFour/source/trees.json`.
-/

